le=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_x_7.\" title=\"9 x 7.\">9 x 7.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.\" title=\"Cows are made of milk.\">Cows are made of milk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thompson.\" title=\"Thompson.\">Thompson.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hey mate.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.\" title=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\">Bats, bats, hang up.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F\" title=\"Is that number got curves?\">Is that number got curves?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.\" title=\"Drier than you think, chalk.\">Drier than you think, chalk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Am_I_an_idiom%3F\" title=\"Am I an idiom?\">Am I an idiom?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_1970s_camping_kettle.\" title=\"A 1970s camping kettle.\">A 1970s camping kettle.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.\" title=\"Supping from the fountain.\">Supping from the fountain.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Hey mate.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/33/Hey_mate..png/revision/latest?cb=20251002214108\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Hey mate.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/33/Hey_mate..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251002214108\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/33/Hey_mate..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251002214108 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/33/Hey_mate..png/revision/latest?cb=20251002214108 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Hey mate.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Hey_mate..png\" data-image-name=\"Hey mate..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thompson.\" title=\"Thompson.\">Thompson.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.\" title=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\">Bats, bats, hang up.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Hey mate.</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 2 October 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hey_mate.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> wastes valuable time during his 10-second voice message to <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_love_heart_using_your_body,_the_body_of_your_teammates_and_any_other_items_of_your_choosing\" title=\"Make a love heart using your body, the body of your teammates and any other items of your choosing\">Make a love heart using your body, the body of your teammates and any other items of your choosing</a> task by starting with the phrase \"Hey mate\", which is repeated by Bhaskar later on in the task, the episode's title. The title card shows the number 63 on an olive stem connected to a small plastic heart. The number 63 references the number Alex wrote down in the <a href=\"/wiki/What_number_has_Alex_written_down%3F\" title=\"What number has Alex written down?\">What number has Alex written down?</a> task (the number 63 itself is recurs throughout <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a>), while the olives reference the <a href=\"/wiki/Win_the_horse_race\" title=\"Win the horse race\">Win the horse race</a> task, and the small plastic heart is a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_love_heart_using_your_body,_the_body_of_your_teammates_and_any_other_items_of_your_choosing\" title=\"Make a love heart using your body, the body of your teammates and any other items of your choosing\">Make a love heart using your body, the body of your teammates and any other items of your choosing</a>.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hey_mate.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>As <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> continues to judge the attempts of five comics attempting to complete his nonsensical tasks, he's learning a lot about the group. For example, <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> reacts strangely to insects, <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> are repulsed by olives, and <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> can remain remarkably calm in the face of a teammate's incompetence. Meanwhile, <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> regrets giving <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> access to his phone.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/4/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_present_that_would_most_make_you_say_this_if_you_received_it_on_your_birthday:_%22Oh,_that%27s_just_the_most_gorgeous_gift_ever!%22\" title=\"The present that would most make you say this if you received it on your birthday: &quot;Oh, that&#39;s just the most gorgeous gift ever!&quot;\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The present that would most make you say this if you received it on your birthday: \"Oh, that's just the most gorgeous gift ever!\".\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/What_number_has_Alex_written_down%3F\" title=\"What number has Alex written down?\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>What number has Alex written down? You may ask no more than 20 questions. Alex may only say yes or no, and you must be increasingly surprised by every answer.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_love_heart_using_your_body,_the_body_of_your_teammates_and_any_other_items_of_your_choosing\" title=\"Make a love heart using your body, the body of your teammates and any other items of your choosing\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Make a love heart using your body, the body of your teammates and any other items of your choosing.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Win_the_horse_race\" title=\"Win the horse race\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Win the horse race. You must do one of the following things: Eat something without looking at the food, spin the wheel at least 720 degrees, throw a dart at the dartboard. If you eat an olive, your horse will advance two steps. If you eat a grape, your horse will retreat three steps. If you throw a dart in an olive, your horse will advance five steps. If you throw a dart in a grape, your horse will retreat eight steps. If the wheel lands on an olive, your horse will advance 10 steps. If the wheel lands on a grape, your horse will retreat 15 steps. You must stay on the spot and you must not move the spot.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Either_convince_the_Taskmaster_you_have_written_something_other_than_what_you_have_written_or_exactly_what_you_have_written\" title=\"Either convince the Taskmaster you have written something other than what you have written or exactly what you have written\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Fill out your form.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Either convince the Taskmaster you have written something other than what you have written or exactly what you have written. If you fail to deceive the Taskmaster, you are eliminated.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_your_shower_cap_by_inflating_the_balloon\" title=\"Remove your shower cap by inflating the balloon\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Remove your shower cap by inflating the balloon.\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hey_mate.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/\"><i>Hey mate.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920140505\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.134 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1013/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26857/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 698/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800508/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   78.566      1 -total\n 52.42%   41.186      1 Template:Spoilers\n 50.52%   39.691      1 Tem